<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1" title="In 4.3 Understanding data-weighting methods ‣ 4 Rethinking the rationales behind recent RL algorithms ‣ Group-Relative REINFORCE Is Secretly an Off-Policy Algorithm:Demystifying Some Myths About GRPO and Its Friends" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Pairwise weighting.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4.3 Understanding data-weighting methods ‣ 4 Rethinking the rationales behind recent RL algorithms ‣ Group-Relative REINFORCE Is Secretly an Off-Policy Algorithm:Demystifying Some Myths About GRPO and Its Friends" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">RED-Drop</span>: sample dropping.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px3" title="In 4.3 Understanding data-weighting methods ‣ 4 Rethinking the rationales behind recent RL algorithms ‣ Group-Relative REINFORCE Is Secretly an Off-Policy Algorithm:Demystifying Some Myths About GRPO and Its Friends" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">RED-Weight</span>: pointwise loss weighting.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px4" title="In 4.3 Understanding data-weighting methods ‣ 4 Rethinking the rationales behind recent RL algorithms ‣ Group-Relative REINFORCE Is Secretly an Off-Policy Algorithm:Demystifying Some Myths About GRPO and Its Friends" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Implementation details.</span></a></li>
