</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Group-Relative REINFORCE Is Secretly an Off-Policy Algorithm:Demystifying Some Myths About GRPO and Its Friends" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Related works</span></a></li>
